C%E8%A6%81%E4%BC%98%E4%BA%8E%E7%9D%A1%E7%BE%8E%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E6%A2%A6%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1635667003497\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\" contenteditable=\"false\" draggable=\"true\" data-empty-text=\"\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"role\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--role obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>适用角色</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__role-table\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/17/91006211/42c5ea7d1d726eaa6ebbaea9e7c34b38_7078377399200448610.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>狂热蓝调Δ</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">狂热蓝调的毕业超限武器，技能属性完美契合，武器主动可以用于完美弹反或者触发极限闪避。</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/17/91006211/d6724383f93e1b89fee93f6ed57443ed_1258722407304230379.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>蓝莓特攻</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">武器主动可以用于完美弹反或者触发极限闪避，虽然只能吃到暴击率加成但仍是蓝莓特攻目前的最佳毕业武器。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/10/91006211/affbf4e194f26da89e2d22d56250c876_4174829515097972597.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">狂热蓝调Δ和蓝莓特攻的专属超限武器，面板中等，会心较高，被动技能暴击加成和初始能量效果，狂热蓝调Δ使用时能加成狂热状态下的普攻物伤。主动技能使用后会对自身及周围敌人造成伤害，这个伤害可以用来触发狂热蓝调Δ和蓝莓特攻必杀技的强化攻击以及女武神极限闪避技能，可以极大程度改善战斗的流程，是战场顶分的必备武器。需特别提醒，樱桃炸弹使用未超限睡美人时，效果要优于睡美人之梦。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/10/91006211/affbf4e194f26da89e2d22d56250c876_4174829515097972597.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
